!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-template-over-a-choice-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.10, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4"
  description: """
    A template's body is a record body, and a choice is not one: its variants are a list, not reference fields, and
    an untagged sum over a parameter could be judged disjoint only once applied. The declaration is refused; a result
    family is declared with records -- an abstract base with a selector, a template composing it, members pinning it
    -- or the alternative is a field group inside an open record.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
